  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience the next level of energy return with the Nike Vomero Plus SE. Designed for serious road runners, these sneakers feature an ultra-responsive ZoomX foam midsole and a breathable engineered mesh upper to keep your stride light and cool. Whether you are hitting the pavement for a morning jog or a long-distance run, the Nike Vomero Plus SE ensures every step feels supported and stable.</p> <p><strong>Features and benefits:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper provides soft breathability.</li> <li>Ultra-responsive ZoomX foam midsole delivers high energy return.</li> <li>High-abrasion rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li> <li>Reflective details for enhanced visibility.</li> <li>Low-cut collar and classic laces for a secure fit.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Material and care:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Smooth weave fabric upper; rubber outsole.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Standard shoe width.</li> <li>Low-top length.</li> <li>Lace-up closure for an adjustable fit.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Plus SE - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Silver/Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh up